<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 43.6pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 36.05pt">1.10.</TD><TD>Qian Sun as a Director</TD></TR></TABLE>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 43.6pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 36.05pt">1.11.</TD><TD>Hui Cheng as an Independent Director</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 36pt">2.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">To approve a reverse stock split (the &ldquo;Reverse Split&rdquo;) of the Company&rsquo;s issued ordinary
shares at a ratio of not less than one (1)-for-three hundred sixty (360) and not more than one (1)-for-seven hundred twenty (720), with
the exact ratio to be set at a whole number within this range to be determined by the Company&rsquo;s Board, or any duly constituted committee
thereof, in its discretion (&ldquo;Proposal Two&rdquo;)</TD></TR></TABLE>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 36pt">3.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Subject to the Shareholders&rsquo; approval of Proposal Two and the Board&rsquo;s implementation of the
Reverse Split, to suspend the trading of the Company&rsquo;s American Depositary Receipts / Shares (&ldquo;ADRs&rdquo;), terminate the
deposit agreement for the ADRs among the Company, its depositary bank, Citibank, N.A. (the &ldquo;Depositary&rdquo;), and the holders
and beneficial owners of the Company&rsquo;s ADRs, the exchange of ADRs for the corresponding ordinary shares of the Company and commence
trading of the Company&rsquo;s ordinary shares on the Nasdaq Stock Market upon the effectiveness of the Reverse Split (&ldquo;Proposal
Three&rdquo;)</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0; margin: 0pt 0">The Depositary has been advised by the Company
that its Board of Directors recommends a vote &quot;FOR&quot; all of the director nominees listed above and &quot;FOR&quot; each of the
other resolutions</P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0; margin: 0pt 0">The Company's Notice of Meeting and related materials are
available through the Company's website, at http://ir.mercurity.com/.</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

